{"id":"06a2d5fe-b3d8-44f5-8bae-a3764f2fe4a8","object":"chat.completion","created":1785014693,"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\"implementation\": \"def solve(case):\\n    threshold = case[\\\"threshold\\\"]\\n    calls = case[\\\"calls\\\"]\\n    accepted_call_ids = []\\n    diagnostics = []\\n    for call in calls:\\n        call_id = call[\\\"call_id\\\"]\\n        loss_without = call[\\\"loss_without_call\\\"]\\n        loss_with = call[\\\"loss_with_call\\\"]\\n        gain = loss_without - loss_with\\n        prediction_tokens = call[\\\"prediction_tokens\\\"]\\n        normalized_gain = gain / prediction_tokens\\n        parseable = call[\\\"parseable\\\"]\\n        accepted = parseable and normalized_gain >= threshold\\n        if accepted:\\n            accepted_call_ids.append(call_id)\\n        diagnostics.append({\\n            \\\"accepted\\\": accepted,\\n            \\\"call_id\\\": call_id,\\n            \\\"normalized_gain\\\": normalized_gain\\n        })\\n    return {\\n        \\\"accepted_call_ids\\\": accepted_call_ids,\\n        \\\"diagnostics\\\": diagnostics\\n    }\"}","reasoning_content":"We need to write a Python function `solve(case)` that processes the given case payload. The case has \"threshold\" and \"calls\" list. Each call has: call_id, loss_without_call, loss_with_call, prediction_tokens, parseable. We need to compute gain = loss_without_call - loss_with_call. Then normalized_gain = gain / prediction_tokens. Then if parseable == True and normalized_gain >= threshold, then accept the call. Return list of accepted_call_ids (strings), and diagnostics array with objects: accepted (boolean), call_id, normalized_gain (float number). Diagnostics in same order as calls.\n\nImportant: normalized_gain must be a number (float). The output schema says \"type\": \"number\". So we can return float. The threshold is 0.05 in examples. Ensure we return accepted_call_ids as list of strings.\n\nWe must not mutate case. We'll read from case.\n\nImplementation: iterate over case[\"calls\"] in order. For each, compute gain and normalized_gain; determine accepted; build diagnostics object; if accepted, add call_id to accepted list. Return dict with accepted_call_ids and diagnostics.\n\nEdge cases: prediction_tokens might be zero? Not mentioned but could be; division by zero should not happen? We'll assume it's positive integer. If not, we might need to handle but spec doesn't say. We'll proceed.\n\nReturn JSON-serializable: dict with list of strings and list of dicts.\n\nWe'll write solve(case) function.\n\nMake sure to return result as Python dict.\n\nNow produce the JSON response with single key \"implementation\" containing the Python source code as a JSON string. Must escape properly.\n\nWe should also include a docstring perhaps but not required.\n\nWe'll write:\n\ndef solve(case):\n    threshold = case[\"threshold\"]\n    calls = case[\"calls\"]\n    accepted_call_ids = []\n    diagnostics = []\n    for call in calls:\n        call_id = call[\"call_id\"]\n        loss_without = call[\"loss_without_call\"]\n        loss_with = call[\"loss_with_call\"]\n        gain = loss_without - loss_with\n        prediction_tokens = call[\"prediction_tokens\"]\n        normalized_gain = gain / prediction_tokens\n        parseable = call[\"parseable\"]\n        accepted = parseable and normalized_gain >= threshold\n        if accepted:\n            accepted_call_ids.append(call_id)\n        diagnostics.append({\n            \"accepted\": accepted,\n            \"call_id\": call_id,\n            \"normalized_gain\": normalized_gain\n        })\n    return {\n        \"accepted_call_ids\": accepted_call_ids,\n        \"diagnostics\": diagnostics\n    }\n\nThat's it.\n\nNow format as JSON string. Must escape newlines and quotes.\n\nWe'll produce a string with the Python code.\n\nMake sure to not include any extra text.\n\nNow write the response."},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":2164,"completion_tokens":838,"total_tokens":3002,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":2048},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":599},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":2048,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":116},"system_fingerprint":"fp_8b330d02d0_prod0820_fp8_kvcache_20260402"}